@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #B99557

title RB-D06 — Actual submitted-set completeness
start
if (RB-D06-C01\nActual identity established = T?) then (yes)
if (RB-D06-C02\nRequired components present = T?) then (yes)
if (RB-D06-C03\nPreservation confirmed = T?) then (yes)
:RB-D06-R07\nCOMPLETE ACTUAL SET;
stop
else (no)
if (RB-D06-C03 = F?) then (yes)
:RB-D06-R05\nCAPTURE NOT COMPLETE;
stop
else (U)
:RB-D06-R06\nCAPTURE UNCONFIRMED;
stop
endif
endif
else (no)
if (RB-D06-C02 = F?) then (yes)
:RB-D06-R03\nINCOMPLETE SET;
stop
else (U)
:RB-D06-R04\nUNRESOLVED COMPLETENESS;
stop
endif
endif
else (no)
if (RB-D06-C01 = F?) then (yes)
:RB-D06-R01\nNOT ACTUAL SET;
stop
else (U)
:RB-D06-R02\nUNRESOLVED PROVENANCE;
stop
endif
endif
legend bottom
Decision alternatives, not execution steps or evaluation timing.
T = established true; F = established false; U = unresolved.
Conditions and full results are defined in the rule table.
All rows here are proposed analysis refinements; no new policy acceptance.
endlegend
@enduml
